WEBVTT

00:00:02.890 --> 00:00:05.440
Thank goodness we managed to pass!

00:00:05.440 --> 00:00:07.270
All thanks to Lord Anos, right?

00:00:07.480 --> 00:00:10.900
If we can pass the next trial,
we'll get to see the Spirit King!

00:00:10.900 --> 00:00:13.240
That makes me... nervous.

00:00:13.650 --> 00:00:14.950
<i>Lord Anos.</i>

00:00:14.950 --> 00:00:16.120
<i>Is that you, Meleheyth?</i>

00:00:16.120 --> 00:00:20.330
<i>We are ready to hold the ceremony
for the Second Coming of the Demon King.</i>

00:00:20.330 --> 00:00:21.000
<i>Hmm.</i>

00:00:21.370 --> 00:00:27.080
<i>We shall be announcing the fact that Avos Dilhevia
was a sham over today's magical broadcast.</i>

00:00:27.460 --> 00:00:31.090
<i>Leave the broadcast to Elio.
You stay out of sight.</i>

00:00:31.090 --> 00:00:31.920
<i>As you wish.</i>

00:02:10.690 --> 00:02:15.150
From here on in, various Spirits
will be tasking you with trials.

00:02:10.860 --> 00:02:15.190
04 - The Spirit’s Trial

00:02:15.150 --> 00:02:20.870
To pass, you must overcome them all,
and reach Enyunien's top.

00:02:21.240 --> 00:02:23.830
Now, then, here's your first trial.

00:02:24.120 --> 00:02:26.120
The Staircases of Geunier.

00:02:26.120 --> 00:02:30.500
You will choose one of these twenty,
and proceed to the upper floors.

00:02:30.500 --> 00:02:35.960
Only five of them lead to the top,
where the Spirit King resides.

00:02:36.260 --> 00:02:40.590
Needless to say, you will not be permitted
to destroy the walls, or to use Gatom.

00:02:40.720 --> 00:02:42.510
When will we know if we're right?

00:02:42.510 --> 00:02:46.350
Stairs heading up when you open
the door will lead to the top.

00:02:46.350 --> 00:02:49.730
Stairs heading down will only lead you back here.

00:02:50.060 --> 00:02:54.020
Huh? Then unless we're lucky,
we're bound to fail.

00:02:54.320 --> 00:02:56.400
Quite an amusing trial.

00:02:56.400 --> 00:02:58.150
You're just wasting your time, Demon King.

00:02:58.150 --> 00:03:01.780
Because you've always been unlucky.

00:03:01.780 --> 00:03:04.870
First you tamper with the questions,
and now the stairs?

00:03:06.540 --> 00:03:09.370
I'd advise you to use
the Magic Sword of Destruction.

00:03:10.750 --> 00:03:13.580
The Spirit Trials will now begin!

00:03:13.880 --> 00:03:16.000
What a dull trial!

00:03:16.000 --> 00:03:19.590
This would be child's play for Kyhilam.

00:03:21.340 --> 00:03:25.470
There are sixteen of us,
so four of us should guess right.

00:03:25.470 --> 00:03:28.140
It'll depend on whether
the Four Evil Royals guess right, of course,

00:03:28.140 --> 00:03:29.640
but I think at least one of us will get lucky.

00:03:29.810 --> 00:03:33.440
But the best scenario would
be Lord Anos getting it right, wouldn't it?

00:03:33.440 --> 00:03:35.730
Is this really just a matter of luck?

00:03:36.150 --> 00:03:38.030
Not necessarily.

00:03:38.030 --> 00:03:39.900
Judging by what the Scarlet Monument King had to say,

00:03:39.900 --> 00:03:42.280
we can assume that he's done some manipulating.

00:03:42.280 --> 00:03:44.570
What if one of us guesses right?

00:03:44.820 --> 00:03:46.200
Yeah...

00:03:46.200 --> 00:03:48.540
I don't think I can make
it through the next trial.

00:03:48.540 --> 00:03:51.710
If only we could give Lord Anos
our winning ticket!

00:03:51.710 --> 00:03:54.170
Hmm. Maybe that's the way to go.

00:03:54.170 --> 00:03:54.830
What?

00:04:03.340 --> 00:04:06.850
What's the meaning of this?

00:04:07.260 --> 00:04:09.850
I want to make sure that there's no foul play.

00:04:10.180 --> 00:04:13.770
If you were so inclined,
you could fail us on purpose, after all.

00:04:14.060 --> 00:04:18.070
As the Great Tree of Education,
I would never do that.

00:04:18.070 --> 00:04:22.440
Even if, say, the Great Spirit Leno's
live were at stake?

00:04:22.440 --> 00:04:24.280
Well...

00:04:24.610 --> 00:04:30.040
Surely you Spirits wouldn't shy away from doing anything
if it was to protect your own mother.

00:04:30.040 --> 00:04:31.580
Mm...

00:04:32.450 --> 00:04:35.330
When I open the door,
I'll show you my true form.

00:04:35.750 --> 00:04:39.670
If you haven't rigged this,
it shouldn't matter to you, right?

00:04:40.800 --> 00:04:44.470
Fine! If that will satisfy you,
I'll humor you.

00:04:55.560 --> 00:04:57.190
Yes! Wrong door!

00:04:57.190 --> 00:05:01.150
I got to do my Lord Anos impression, too!
This just might be my lucky day!

00:05:03.820 --> 00:05:04.990
Wrong door!

00:05:06.740 --> 00:05:07.740
All right!

00:05:11.740 --> 00:05:14.080
Who else picked the right door?

00:05:14.580 --> 00:05:16.420
Looks like luck was on my side.

00:05:16.710 --> 00:05:18.630
I picked the right one, too!

00:05:18.960 --> 00:05:24.220
<i>Splitting our 16 Sources equally, then requiring them
to gather at the stairways going up upon return,</i>

00:05:24.220 --> 00:05:27.800
<i>worked out better than I thought.</i>

00:05:28.840 --> 00:05:29.720
Who are you?

00:05:31.560 --> 00:05:32.970
Was it here?

00:05:34.680 --> 00:05:35.430
Oh...

00:05:35.810 --> 00:05:38.940
Lena, didn't you choose the wrong door?

00:05:38.940 --> 00:05:41.360
Yes. But I remembered something!

00:05:41.980 --> 00:05:45.070
That there should be a hidden passageway
in the staircase.

00:05:45.070 --> 00:05:46.070
You heard that, right?

00:05:46.450 --> 00:05:48.030
<i>Find the hidden passageway.</i>

00:05:48.450 --> 00:05:51.120
<i>It should lead to the path to the top.</i>

00:05:51.120 --> 00:05:52.700
- Right.
- Okay.

00:05:53.870 --> 00:05:57.000
Seems like you've gone through a Spirit Trial before.

00:05:57.000 --> 00:06:02.210
I'm not sure about that... but I have
a feeling that I've been to the top.

00:06:02.210 --> 00:06:05.550
Then let me know if anything comes back to you.

00:06:05.550 --> 00:06:06.420
Okay.

00:06:36.660 --> 00:06:37.330
Hey.

00:06:37.910 --> 00:06:38.870
What is it?

00:06:41.250 --> 00:06:43.420
I think... there's a door here.

00:06:46.170 --> 00:06:47.380
Shall we open it?

00:06:50.090 --> 00:06:51.010
Huh?

00:06:58.600 --> 00:07:03.980
Wait... This can't be right.
What happened?

00:07:06.190 --> 00:07:09.950
It seems like I've been here more than once.

00:07:34.720 --> 00:07:38.060
I feel so sad...
I've got to go.

00:07:38.270 --> 00:07:42.520
There's something that I should have said.

00:07:42.520 --> 00:07:43.900
To the Spirit King?

00:07:43.900 --> 00:07:45.770
Yes, probably.

00:07:45.770 --> 00:07:46.730
I see.

00:07:48.150 --> 00:07:51.530
Show yourself.
I know that you're there.

00:07:51.860 --> 00:07:54.490
<i>Forgive me for startling you, Your Majesty.</i>

00:07:54.490 --> 00:07:55.700
Is that you, Jiste?

00:07:56.080 --> 00:07:58.240
I've been waiting for you to come.

00:07:58.240 --> 00:08:01.540
Since we can be free
of the Spirits' surveillance here.

00:08:01.540 --> 00:08:05.630
Hmm. It sounds like you're
at odds with the Spirits?

00:08:06.090 --> 00:08:10.090
Lord Kyhilam has been spirited away
by the Hidden Wolf Gennul.

00:08:10.340 --> 00:08:13.680
Meaning that only the King
of Curses' Source has vanished?

00:08:13.680 --> 00:08:17.890
But isn't that the King of Curses,
Kyhilam Jiste?

00:08:18.260 --> 00:08:20.470
He has a split personality.

00:08:20.470 --> 00:08:22.890
Kyhilam and his lover, Jiste.

00:08:22.890 --> 00:08:25.440
He has both personalities and Sources.

00:08:25.440 --> 00:08:29.690
Not that we failed our trials,
but it was on the Spirit King's order.

00:08:30.150 --> 00:08:35.110
He bullied Lord Gerad into doing his bidding
if he wanted to get the King of Curses back.

00:08:35.110 --> 00:08:37.070
That's why he went to Delsgade.

00:08:37.870 --> 00:08:42.080
Gerad had half of a Magic Sword.
Where did he get it?

00:08:42.500 --> 00:08:45.040
Most likely from the Spirit King.

00:08:45.330 --> 00:08:47.290
He told him to use it as bait.

00:08:47.590 --> 00:08:49.960
Is Eges, the King of the Netherworld,
involved, as well?

00:08:49.960 --> 00:08:55.010
He's also being held hostage.
I think that's why he's here in this School Building.

00:08:55.380 --> 00:08:57.090
Who is the Spirit King?

00:08:57.600 --> 00:09:02.140
I'm told that he's been protecting
the Spirits in place of the Great Spirit Leno,

00:09:02.140 --> 00:09:04.640
who vanished after you were reincarnated.

00:09:04.940 --> 00:09:06.940
I did see him, just once.

00:09:06.940 --> 00:09:08.270
This is what he looks like.

00:09:09.820 --> 00:09:11.980
The man who appeared
at the Magic Sword Tournament...

00:09:12.360 --> 00:09:15.910
The Spirit King,
disguised as Avos Dilhevia?

00:09:15.910 --> 00:09:18.280
But what is he after?

00:09:19.330 --> 00:09:20.870
I beg of you, Your Majesty.

00:09:21.160 --> 00:09:23.120
Please save Lord Kyhilam.

00:09:23.120 --> 00:09:25.830
I'm aware that you two don't get along, but...

00:09:27.170 --> 00:09:29.710
My subordinates have also vanished.

00:09:29.710 --> 00:09:31.750
I'll save Kyhilam along with them.

00:09:32.800 --> 00:09:33.960
Thank you!

00:09:35.630 --> 00:09:36.760
<i>Anos?</i>

00:09:36.760 --> 00:09:37.680
What is it?

00:09:38.140 --> 00:09:41.010
I was able to join Misa,
so we'll be moving on together.

00:09:41.010 --> 00:09:42.140
<i>Fine.</i>

00:09:42.140 --> 00:09:43.060
Misa?

00:09:43.060 --> 00:09:43.810
Oh!

00:09:44.140 --> 00:09:47.100
Sorry. But it's faster this way.

00:09:55.360 --> 00:09:57.150
Oh! There's a door!

00:10:06.870 --> 00:10:08.460
Oh!

00:10:10.630 --> 00:10:12.670
The Hidden Wolf, Gennul.

00:10:13.050 --> 00:10:14.670
You may pass.

00:10:16.220 --> 00:10:17.340
Are you sure?

00:10:17.340 --> 00:10:20.090
I won't task you with a trial as you pass.

00:10:24.810 --> 00:10:25.980
Stay with me.

00:10:25.980 --> 00:10:26.980
Right.

00:10:32.310 --> 00:10:35.860
I was sure something was going to happen... oh?

00:10:39.070 --> 00:10:40.660
Look at that!

00:10:46.040 --> 00:10:49.080
<i>I'm impressed that you got this far!</i>

00:10:49.080 --> 00:10:53.460
<i>I shall grant you an audience with the Spirit King.</i>

00:10:59.010 --> 00:11:01.140
I'd like to ask you something, Spirit King.

00:11:01.470 --> 00:11:04.050
Do you bear a grudge against the Demon King?

00:11:07.140 --> 00:11:12.860
<i>Unfortunately, you'll have to undergo
a trial to speak with His Majesty.</i>

00:11:12.860 --> 00:11:13.770
What kind of trial?

00:11:13.980 --> 00:11:18.860
<i>Battle the Spirit King, and if you
can split his mask, you'll pass.</i>

00:11:18.990 --> 00:11:23.570
<i>However, you may only use your own body
and spirit as your weapons.</i>

00:11:23.870 --> 00:11:26.120
<i>All of these swords are Spirits.</i>

00:11:26.120 --> 00:11:29.960
<i>You will be allowed to used them
if you're capable of wielding them.</i>

00:11:32.040 --> 00:11:33.750
I'll take on the trial.

00:11:52.730 --> 00:11:56.820
Hmph. What can you call this but fate?

00:11:56.820 --> 00:11:58.030
I agree.

00:11:58.280 --> 00:12:01.530
You will be tasked with the Hidden Wolf Trial.

00:12:01.530 --> 00:12:06.830
Capture me if you can. Only the one
who succeeds first will be allowed to pass.

00:12:07.160 --> 00:12:09.950
<i>Shall we join forces, Demon King Anos?</i>

00:12:09.950 --> 00:12:12.540
<i>You go on through the door.</i>

00:12:12.540 --> 00:12:15.330
<i>I'll rescue the ones who were spirited away.</i>

00:12:15.580 --> 00:12:19.170
<i>Hmm. Do you know how
to go about rescuing them?</i>

00:12:19.170 --> 00:12:22.010
<i>I wouldn't propose joining forces otherwise.</i>

00:12:22.840 --> 00:12:24.130
<i>Fine.</i>

00:12:24.720 --> 00:12:25.470
Huh?

00:12:25.850 --> 00:12:27.220
Stay right there.

00:12:27.220 --> 00:12:28.310
O-Okay.

00:12:29.010 --> 00:12:31.020
Go ahead and start the trial.

00:12:48.080 --> 00:12:51.120
I know that that body's just an illusion.

00:12:51.120 --> 00:12:53.460
Show us your true form!

00:12:53.660 --> 00:12:56.210
<i>I am the Hidden Wolf Gennul.</i>

00:12:56.210 --> 00:13:01.630
<i>I am the Spirit of Vanishment,
and I show myself to no one.</i>

00:13:02.010 --> 00:13:03.550
Riga Shrade.

00:13:14.230 --> 00:13:15.060
Beno Ievun.

00:13:21.690 --> 00:13:23.530
<i>The Spirit girl...</i>

00:13:23.530 --> 00:13:25.150
<i>Vanished, eh?</i>

00:13:25.450 --> 00:13:28.320
<i>What was Lena doing just before she vanished?</i>

00:13:29.490 --> 00:13:30.990
So that's what this is?

00:13:30.990 --> 00:13:33.370
<i>You've figured something out, Demon King?</i>

00:13:33.370 --> 00:13:36.920
<i>Yes. I'm going to capture that Hidden Wolf Gennul.</i>

00:13:36.920 --> 00:13:37.830
<i>Then...</i>

00:13:38.210 --> 00:13:42.300
<i>Those who've vanished must be inside his body.</i>

00:13:43.510 --> 00:13:46.430
<i>You can create an entrance with your Magic Spear.</i>

00:13:53.890 --> 00:13:57.440
<i>The Spirit of Vanishment shows himself to no one.</i>

00:13:57.440 --> 00:13:58.520
<i>On the flip side...</i>

00:13:58.810 --> 00:14:02.360
<i>You only appear before those
whose eyes are closed.</i>

00:14:02.690 --> 00:14:05.860
Impressive. You may pass.

00:14:09.780 --> 00:14:10.870
<i>Well?</i>

00:14:10.870 --> 00:14:13.580
<i>That cur hasn't caught on.</i>

00:14:13.740 --> 00:14:17.870
Leave the Spirit girl and yours subordinates to me.

00:14:18.210 --> 00:14:21.090
I just hope that I don't end up battling you.

00:14:21.090 --> 00:14:23.710
We'll just have to leave that to fate.

00:14:28.010 --> 00:14:28.680
Cyphio!

00:14:33.850 --> 00:14:35.640
The Treasured Sword Ailearrow.

00:14:35.640 --> 00:14:38.850
A Spirit who seals objects
and people away inside jewels.

00:14:46.900 --> 00:14:49.110
I possess seven Sources.

00:14:49.700 --> 00:14:52.320
It would be quicker to seal them
than to destroy them.

00:14:52.660 --> 00:14:56.330
You took up that sword as if you knew that.

00:14:57.250 --> 00:14:59.460
Have we battled each other before somewhere?

00:15:05.550 --> 00:15:07.090
Take that!

00:15:15.260 --> 00:15:19.810
As I'm a half-Spirit,
I'm allowed to help you, right?

00:15:24.570 --> 00:15:26.530
Spirit Magic...

00:15:31.780 --> 00:15:33.070
Gigadeal!

00:15:43.920 --> 00:15:44.630
Misa!

00:15:45.380 --> 00:15:46.960
Lay, take this.

00:15:46.960 --> 00:15:48.050
Thanks.

00:15:49.170 --> 00:15:51.760
Is that your true form?

00:15:52.840 --> 00:15:55.720
Is it, I wonder?
I was out of my mind.

00:15:56.310 --> 00:15:57.810
How are you feeling?

00:15:57.810 --> 00:16:00.180
I'm fine, thank you.
And besides...

00:16:00.770 --> 00:16:03.850
I can't be worried about
my condition when you're in a jam!

00:16:08.610 --> 00:16:10.820
You are my sword.

00:16:11.860 --> 00:16:14.110
As long as you're looking at me,

00:16:14.110 --> 00:16:16.280
as long as I'm battling with you by my side,

00:16:16.280 --> 00:16:17.990
there's no way that I can ever lose.

00:16:18.290 --> 00:16:19.660
Do you believe me?

00:16:20.080 --> 00:16:21.160
Yes.

00:16:27.710 --> 00:16:29.510
Take that!

00:16:46.860 --> 00:16:49.980
I knew it... you do know me from before.

00:16:50.650 --> 00:16:54.240
With the Spirit Sword snapped,
you're taking slightly bigger swings.

00:16:55.070 --> 00:16:58.200
You knew that I couldn't use
this Theo Aske, didn't you?

00:16:58.580 --> 00:17:02.450
Layering true love into one,
then converting it into magical power.

00:17:02.790 --> 00:17:04.420
The Hero's Secret Technique.

00:17:05.420 --> 00:17:08.750
I have obtained love now!

00:17:09.880 --> 00:17:11.050
Theo Torearos!

00:17:17.300 --> 00:17:19.140
And I've won, right?

00:17:19.510 --> 00:17:21.430
You can't fight me in that condition, can you?

00:17:21.930 --> 00:17:24.060
Yes, you're right.

00:17:35.780 --> 00:17:37.070
It's over for you.

00:17:37.780 --> 00:17:39.120
Lay!

00:17:41.740 --> 00:17:42.750
Theo Try—

00:17:53.010 --> 00:17:55.720
Hmm. I know you're a fake.

00:17:55.970 --> 00:17:59.850
Welcome to my research lab!

00:17:59.850 --> 00:18:02.140
I don't have time to fool around with you.

00:18:02.140 --> 00:18:04.930
But this is a Spirit Trial.

00:18:04.980 --> 00:18:09.020
If you ignore it, you'll never reach
the Spirit King's castle.

00:18:09.270 --> 00:18:11.150
State the nature of the trial.

00:18:11.150 --> 00:18:14.780
You and I will vie for supremacy.

00:18:17.950 --> 00:18:20.910
However, we can only use
the magical power of those monuments there.

00:18:21.080 --> 00:18:26.290
We'll see whose magical technology
reigns supreme in a fair fight!

00:18:26.290 --> 00:18:28.250
This is an ancient magic circle!

00:18:28.670 --> 00:18:31.210
Forgotten due to its difficulty,

00:18:31.210 --> 00:18:35.090
this magical formula, which can amplify
magical power to its limits,

00:18:35.300 --> 00:18:40.760
was revived by yours truly thanks
to my 2,000 years of research.

00:18:41.100 --> 00:18:42.810
I'll test it, then.

00:18:50.480 --> 00:18:53.440
You have no hope of reaching
the bottom of the abyss with this.

00:18:53.610 --> 00:18:55.280
That's just sour grapes!

00:18:55.280 --> 00:18:57.780
You only have one monument left.

00:18:57.780 --> 00:19:00.990
Meaning I have twice the magical power!

00:19:02.120 --> 00:19:03.870
Take a look!

00:19:04.120 --> 00:19:07.120
This is the Ancient Literary Magic Lehg Noavs!

00:19:07.540 --> 00:19:09.830
What I can see at the bottom of the abyss...

00:19:09.830 --> 00:19:12.250
...is a Magical Formula controlling
unlimited magical power.

00:19:12.250 --> 00:19:16.380
And at this moment,
no one is closer to that abyss... than I!

00:19:23.800 --> 00:19:27.730
I shall now announce the result of this trial.

00:19:28.230 --> 00:19:31.310
You've failed!

00:19:31.310 --> 00:19:32.190
Hmm?

00:19:32.190 --> 00:19:34.690
<i>Just because you have twice the magical power...</i>

00:19:35.230 --> 00:19:38.030
<i>Did you really think you could make up
for the gap in our abilities?</i>

00:19:40.400 --> 00:19:43.660
Impossible!
I have unlimited magical power!

00:19:43.910 --> 00:19:47.910
No. For starters,
Ancient Magic is for the weak.

00:19:47.910 --> 00:19:52.790
Since it focuses on efficiency, far from being unlimited,
it reaches its limits faster.

00:19:52.790 --> 00:19:56.000
That goes for even this Ji Noavs,
the most advanced spell.

00:19:56.000 --> 00:19:58.590
That must be why our predecessors
abandoned the formula.

00:19:58.670 --> 00:20:00.090
Ridiculous!

00:20:00.090 --> 00:20:05.180
My research doesn't have a single flaw!

00:20:08.470 --> 00:20:11.060
The bottom of the abyss that you strove for...

00:20:11.060 --> 00:20:15.860
...is nothing but a shallow stream
that I long since passed by 2,000 years ago.

00:21:20.500 --> 00:21:22.050
Raeluente.

00:21:28.600 --> 00:21:32.430
Even with your Holy Sword sealed,
I never thought that you'd lose.

00:21:33.850 --> 00:21:35.270
Where's Misa?

00:21:35.270 --> 00:21:38.480
It's safe to assume that
the Spirit King took her with him.

00:21:41.570 --> 00:21:43.690
Anos, the Spirit King is probably...

00:21:43.690 --> 00:21:44.740
Is it Shin?

00:21:46.570 --> 00:21:48.950
It looked like he was hiding
his swordsmanship style,

00:21:48.950 --> 00:21:50.280
but it was remarkably similar.

00:21:51.040 --> 00:21:54.000
He's head and shoulders stronger
than he was 2,000 years ago.

00:21:54.000 --> 00:21:55.080
Anos!

00:21:55.710 --> 00:21:57.120
We have a crisis brewing!

00:21:58.080 --> 00:22:01.090
Look at this!
It's Dilhade's magical broadcast!

00:22:01.340 --> 00:22:08.220
My fellow demons. In the recent war,
we learned how foolish the Humans are.

00:22:08.220 --> 00:22:10.470
That goes for the lowly Demons as well.

00:22:10.800 --> 00:22:14.140
Therefore, it is up to us to make it right.

00:22:14.520 --> 00:22:20.150
My noble Royals. Come gather around
the Demon King of Tyranny, Avos Dilhevia.

00:22:20.400 --> 00:22:23.570
You lowly hybrids, so far removed
from the founding father.

00:22:23.820 --> 00:22:27.110
Bow down before us,
and nourish us.

00:22:27.820 --> 00:22:30.320
Come forth,
Seven Elder Demon Emperors.

00:22:32.740 --> 00:22:35.910
Answer me. Who am I?

00:22:35.910 --> 00:22:39.080
Your Majesty, Avos Dilhevia,
the Demon King of Tyranny.

00:22:39.080 --> 00:22:42.040
You are the one who rules over all.

00:22:42.210 --> 00:22:44.260
State our long-cherished desire.

00:22:44.260 --> 00:22:47.590
That would be to turn
the right ideal into a reality,

00:22:47.590 --> 00:22:49.800
a world ruled only by the Royals.

00:22:50.010 --> 00:22:55.100
There are foolish hybrid demons
who go against our ideal.

00:22:55.310 --> 00:22:59.350
Let me inform all Royals.
You are to kill the misfit.

00:22:59.650 --> 00:23:02.610
Kill Anos Voldigoad!

00:23:03.570 --> 00:23:05.030
What is this?

00:23:05.030 --> 00:23:07.190
That's not the Spirit King.

00:23:13.660 --> 00:23:14.790
What?

00:23:15.120 --> 00:23:20.960
The Great Spirit Avos Dilhevia, based on the rumors
and lore of the Demon King of Tyranny.

00:23:22.000 --> 00:23:24.630
So that was your true form.

00:23:25.630 --> 00:23:26.460
Misa.

00:23:35.640 --> 00:23:39.980
BETWEEN ROYALTY AND MIXED BLOOD

00:23:36.930 --> 00:23:39.310
Between Royalty and Mixed Blood.
